# ── KiCad ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# KiCad auto-save and backup files
**/*-backups/
**/_autosave-*
**/#auto_saved_files#/
**/*.lck
**/fp-info-cache
**/sym-info-cache

# KiCad local settings (not shared between developers)
**/fabrication-toolkit-options.json

# KiCad generated outputs (re-generate from source)
# Uncomment the lines below if you prefer not to track generated files:
# **/*.kicad_prl   # per-user local settings
# **/gerber/
# **/assembly/

# ── Operating system ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~

# ── Editor / IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Python bytecode and envs
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
.python-version
.uv/
uv.lock
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# KiCad extras
PCB/HermesFC/manufacturing/
PCB/HermesFC/kibot/
_autosave-*
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
